 notes={'match3_equivalence':'Source level 5 is explicitly colourless; that rule is preserved. The approved image uses coloured tiles. The original selected hero pose and regenerated frame details differ.','prime_pop':'The original question wording, bubble counts, diameters, values, motion and scoring are retained. They differ from illustrative concept values. Regenerated art differs in fine detail.','fraction_forge':'The actual commission/XP/heat status is retained. The original method tip is in the existing Help dialog; live success/error explanations remain on screen. Real questions and fraction values vary.'}.get(s['key'],'')
