 notes=notes or {'polygon_palace':'Actual SVG shapes, rotations, solids and all question modes are retained. Regenerated guide, pedestal and fine frame ornaments differ.','angle_arena':'Original automatic launch, collisions, timing and scoring are retained. The concept’s proposed manual-power/Fire/destruction mechanics are not added. Tower artwork is scenery only.','area_architect':'Original unit squares, holes, dimensions, answer choices and five-room goal are retained. The table, architect and controls are independent layers. Illustrative values vary.','rotation_relay':'Original translation/reflection/description, pointer projection, vertex placement, drag, keyboard, cursor, hints and explanations remain live. The scalable hollow frame has compact corners; illustrative examples and fine frame details vary.'}.get(s['key'],'')
