 notes=notes or {'coordinates_quest':'All original five route moves, equal-unit grid points, labels, original point/keyboard grading and live console remain functional. The illustrative route is shorter.','perimeter_path':'The original eight labelled outside edges, units, answers, scoring and twelve-question goal are retained. The regenerated stone table and hero pose vary in fine detail;44px edge alternatives are available.','conversion_canyon':'All eight source weights are retained rather than the six illustrative tiles, using three rows. Target values, physical load response, overload/repair and five shipments remain original.','mean_machine':'Original Scan, mean/missing-reading questions, score bonuses, timed feedback and ten repairs are retained. Unknown readings remain hidden before Scan. Engine, tablets and selected hero are independent assets; fine ornament details vary.','graph_grabber':'Original shipment data, crate symbols, local clock, original lives/XP and seven rounds are retained. A44px Trace panel supplements fine chart labels. Regenerated frame, guide and fine ornaments differ.'}.get(s['key'],'')
