 notes=notes or {'potion_panic':'Original recipes, locked starting amounts, all five ingredients, three-brew goal,100XP/brew and760ms active feedback remain live. Exact approved20-drop recipe reproduced through unchanged generator seed22. Original plus/Reset controls retained; approved per-ingredient minus has no source rule. Live mixture is blue for Azure5. Independent regenerated scenery, four reader identities, hearth, open cauldron and UI layers; fine details differ. Native iOS unverified.'}.get(s['key'],'')
